  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to research in Angola</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to socio-political and economic research in Angola through a consortium consisting of Scanteam and Christian Michelsen Insitute. The programme aims to build the capacity of Angolan research institutions to increase the availability of relevant, high quality science-based and independent research in Angola in order to enhance decision-makers&#x2019;, media and the public&#x2019;s knowledge and understanding of the current and up-coming economic and socio-political issues in Angola.</narrative>
  </description>
